  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Hello, for a pleasant and interesting game you need to be vigilant and
    careful.

    All you need is to swipe the bull, in order to move to the right
    or to the left you need to swipe to the right or to the left, in order to jump
    over an obstacle you need to swipe up.

    In the game you need to collect hay
    and star-coins, hay gives you the opportunity to become bigger and stronger,
    you will need to live longer and break through as many walls as possible at the
    end, the walls are not simple they give multipliers of the final number of points
    collected and star-coins.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25219ddd49baea24c8aa2cc62ea94892, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 9152863223269347124, guid: 25219ddd49baea24c8aa2cc62ea94892, type: 2}
